    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2728Features <strong>Three</strong> Main Sections</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc84Makeup Section\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a <strong>makeup artist</strong>, offering a wide range of <strong>cosmetic services</strong>. From applying <strong>blush, eyeshadow, mascara, glitter and liner</strong> to switching up <strong>hair styles, brows, lashes and eye lenses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>coloring</strong> hair lashes and brow, each look is yours to create. Enhance skin with a <strong>scrub and steam</strong> routine, experiment with <strong>artistic markers</strong>. Top it off with <strong>lipstick</strong> classic, glossy, or glitter finishes, and personalize it further with <strong>accessories</strong>\u00a0like <strong>glasses, lenses, or nose piercings</strong>. Every brushstroke offers a chance to <strong>explore your creativity</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc85 Nails &amp; Pedicure Section \ud83d\udc63</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer clients a relaxing <strong>manicure</strong> and <strong>pedicure</strong> service by <strong>filing</strong> and <strong>polishing fingernails</strong> and <strong>toenails</strong>, refreshing their feet with a <strong>scrub brush</strong>. Take it a step further by attaching <strong>stylish nail extensions</strong>, giving each client a personalized look that truly stands out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Photography Section \ud83d\udc57</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >capture your clients' final look by letting them take <strong>stunning photos</strong> with a <strong>virtual camera</strong>, change their outfit for a unique style, and use a <strong>green screen to switch backgrounds</strong>. Adjust <strong>poses and facial expressions</strong> for the perfect shot, then <strong>pin and store</strong> your favorite styles on your wall of fame to celebrate your best creations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2728Features <strong>Three</strong> Main Sections</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc84Makeup Section\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a <strong>makeup artist</strong>, offering a wide range of <strong>cosmetic services</strong>. From applying <strong>blush, eyeshadow, mascara, glitter and liner</strong> to switching up <strong>hair styles, brows, lashes and eye lenses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>coloring</strong> hair lashes and brow, each look is yours to create. Enhance skin with a <strong>scrub and steam</strong> routine, experiment with <strong>artistic markers</strong>. Top it off with <strong>lipstick</strong> classic, glossy, or glitter finishes, and personalize it further with <strong>accessories</strong>\u00a0like <strong>glasses, lenses, or nose piercings</strong>. Every brushstroke offers a chance to <strong>explore your creativity</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc85 Nails &amp; Pedicure Section \ud83d\udc63</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offer clients a relaxing <strong>manicure</strong> and <strong>pedicure</strong> service by <strong>filing</strong> and <strong>polishing fingernails</strong> and <strong>toenails</strong>, refreshing their feet with a <strong>scrub brush</strong>. Take it a step further by attaching <strong>stylish nail extensions</strong>, giving each client a personalized look that truly stands out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Photography Section \ud83d\udc57</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >capture your clients' final look by letting them take <strong>stunning photos</strong> with a <strong>virtual camera</strong>, change their outfit for a unique style, and use a <strong>green screen to switch backgrounds</strong>. Adjust <strong>poses and facial expressions</strong> for the perfect shot, then <strong>pin and store</strong> your favorite styles on your wall of fame to celebrate your best creations.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into the ultimate virtual beauty salon experience! Transform your clients with a variety of makeup, pedicure tools, extensions, accessories and outfits in this creative and relaxing simulation sandbox. Customize every detail of their look, snap stunning photos, and let your imagination shine!",
